#: sumup-payment-gateway-for-woocommerce.php:288
msgid "Use a publicly reachable HTTPS domain before connecting SumUp. If you are testing locally, use a tunnel such as ngrok or Cloudflare Tunnel and update WordPress Home and Site URL first."
